From 04b9f98d911b1e34be3b09699401449bff202f23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 02:44:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/51] Add password / SMS login through Bilibili's official
 page

WebLoginWindow hosts mini-login-v2 (the page the Windows client uses) in
a non-persistent WebKit store with v0.1.2's host bridge: window.browser
context and the livehime_login shim at document start, biliBridgePc after
load, messages accepted only from the live.bilibili.com main frame. The
page handles passwords, captchas, SMS and secondary verification. Once the
session cookies are complete they are saved to the Keychain and verified
exactly like a QR login. v0.1.2's bridge contract and its tests move into
the core.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
